{"unit_id":"Flan246__dsh-lit-search#card-zh","repo":"Flan246/dsh-lit-search","commit":"2a377b1fc0f930362a18b8e0c4851bcfd9807c38","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lit-search 为 DSH agent 提供学术文献检索与引用工具，通过 Cordis 注册四个工具：lit_search、lit_cite、lit_bib 和 lit_related。它可跨 Crossref、OpenAlex、Semantic Scholar 搜索并合并去重论文，支持年份筛选及按引用数或日期排序；也能按 DOI 生成 GB/T 7714、APA、BibTeX 引文，批量整理 BibTeX，并查询 OpenAlex 相关论文。适合需要查找论文和整理参考文献的研究流程。无需 API key，联网使用公开文献 API，可选配置代理。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.ts:19-102","src/core/search.ts:12-67","src/core/cite.ts:16-48","src/core/bib.ts:7-19","src/core/related.ts:7-32"]}
